LC 5 — Longest Palindromic Substring
Pattern:Expand Around Center

Logic:
Expand from every center and keep the longest palindrome.

Algorithm:
For each index:
    check odd palindrome
    check even palindrome
    keep longest

CODE:
class Solution {
public:
    string longestPalindrome(string s) {
        string ans = "";

        for (int i = 0; i < s.size(); i++) {
            for (int l = i, r = i; l >= 0 && r < s.size() && s[l] == s[r]; l--, r++)
                if (r - l + 1 > ans.size()) ans = s.substr(l, r - l + 1);

            for (int l = i, r = i + 1; l >= 0 && r < s.size() && s[l] == s[r]; l--, r++)
                if (r - l + 1 > ans.size()) ans = s.substr(l, r - l + 1);
        }

        return ans;
    }
};

EX:
s = "babad"

"bab" → palindrome ✅
"aba" → palindrome ✅

Longest length = 3
Answer = "bab" (or "aba") ✅











